w many grams i'm getting  from soy absolutely not  uh so i i try to separate out like from  a purely empirical point of view there  are case reports trending in that  direction with extremely high intakes  and very well controlled trials showing  no such effect up to about 80 grams a  day would i start getting nervous if i  had 100 grams a day coming from soy  products  i definitely wouldn't uh i'm pretty  comfortable that  unless you have a truly anomalous intake  of soy  you're probably not going to run into  these types of concerns that that would  be my my estimation but to make that  estimation you do have to deviate from  the empirical evidence a little bit
 

